Halden VT-4 — third-party notices

1) Circuit

The circuit of the Halden VT-4 (passive "bridged injection" LC network,
stage design, power supply and transformer models) is an original design
written for this project. It is not a copy of any commercial device.
5751, 6922 / E88CC and GZ34 are generic vacuum-tube type designations; the
tube models were fitted to their published characteristic curves.

